--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *The controlled shift of Lemma 10 as a block rotation*: For a layout `Λ` on `sh = A ++ Q :: C` with the target field `i` at position `|A|`, unit
--   coefficient `u = 1` and controls only before the target (`c j = 0` for `j ≥ i`), the controlled
--   shift `shiftArr Λ i 1 c` is the block rotation `pull [vol A, Q, vol C] [vol A, Q, vol C]
--   (rotAddr Q (offs Λ c A))` where block `p` (the prefix digits) is rotated by
--   `offs Λ c A p = (Σ_j c_j · digit_j(decode A p)).val`.
